{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.010174418787512574,"t":"E","x":0.17901234549763997,"w":0.014403292338053403,"c":1,"y":0.15552325562077862},{"x":0.17695473253007066,"w":0.016460905075073251,"t":"F","h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"y":0.33284883702175361},{"x":0.8350456504492032,"y":0.11265431578549467,"c":1,"h":0.015112282670990518,"t":"Reading","w":0.072828254699706996},{"c":1,"w":0.68529215494791673,"t":"We discovered that 19th-century hospital wards could generate up to 24 air changes","y":0.15376213707471997,"x":0.21600437367469585,"h":0.016980221751721869},{"y":0.16993265994770623,"c":1,"x":0.21806294184625738,"w":0.6482572937011718,"t":"an hour - that's similar to the performance of a modern-day, computer-controlled","h":0.014555740131787065},{"y":0.18604651150796614,"w":0.67283950805664061,"x":0.22016460800533746,"t":"operating theatre. We believe you could build wards based on these principles now.","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"y":0.20930232546183525,"x":0.22016461617185484,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"Single rooms are not appropriate for all patients. Communal wards appropriate tor","w":0.67489710489908861},{"x":0.22011956232721636,"y":0.22381438451060054,"h":0.015389541293482356,"c":1,"t":"certain patients - older people with dementia, for example - would work just as well","w":0.68733642578124998},{"y":0.23683384899315163,"c":1,"t":"in today's hospitals, at a fraction of the energy cost.'","x":0.21792636951058153,"w":0.4305117797851562,"h":0.019985452838443996},{"x":0.22016462005134921,"c":1,"y":0.26295641952105364,"h":0.013250883392226021,"t":"Professor Short contends the mindset and skill-sets behind these designs have","w":0.65020573933919279},{"c":1,"x":0.22016461710877724,"y":0.2790697673221969,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.66872426350911462,"t":"been completely lost, lamenting the disappearance of expertly designed theatres,"},{"y":0.29254390238799521,"h":0.017525104527198243,"t":"opera houses, and other buildings where up to half the volume of the building was","w":0.67300862630208325,"x":0.22008359620415927,"c":1},{"y":0.30908063423436238,"t":"given over to ensuring everyone got fresh air.","w":0.37267262776692711,"h":0.01551733589846338,"c":1,"x":0.2200117370081803},{"x":0.20576131770272299,"y":0.33274440524530735,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.66049382527669265,"c":1,"t":"Much of the ingenuity present in 19th-century hospital and building design was"},{"x":0.21810700781617792,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"y":0.34738372078139823,"t":"driven by a panicked public clamouring for buildings that could protect against","w":0.6440328979492187},{"w":0.68735743204752608,"h":0.017549744483579377,"x":0.21598969960362049,"y":0.36223649225552212,"t":"what was thought to be the lethal threat of miasmas - toxic air that spread disease.","c":1},{"h":0.017156732377230921,"c":1,"y":0.37766194936806508,"w":0.61535105387369793,"x":0.21804247949373007,"t":"Miasmas were feared as the principal agents of disease and epidemics for"},{"w":0.66268244425455736,"y":0.39321422156353392,"t":"centuries, and were used to explain the spread of infection from the Middle Ages","h":0.016889357594915722,"x":0.21804405339962291,"c":1},{"h":0.018632253011067634,"c":1,"t":"right through to the cholera outbreaks in London and Paris during the 1850s. Foul .","x":0.21801409708610245,"y":0.40823361775874578,"w":0.68123657226562506},{"t":"air, rather than germs, was believed to be the main driver of 'hospital fever, leading","h":0.017667844522968212,"y":0.4243227326948481,"x":0.21810700138490519,"w":0.68724278767903635,"c":1},{"y":0.44040697659583428,"w":0.60905349731445302,"x":0.21604938299271453,"h":0.016012340046912987,"c":1,"t":"to disease and frequent death. The prosperous steered clear of hospitals."},{"y":0.46366279054608261,"w":0.66049382527669276,"t":"While miasma theory has been long since disproved, Short has for the last 30 years","x":0.21810699689899632,"h":0.016019188192342826,"c":1},{"t":"advocated a return to some of the building design principles produced in its wake.","y":0.47965116265631691,"h":0.014534883982160851,"w":0.64403289794921881,"x":0.21810700776807171,"c":1},{"t":"Today, huge amounts of a building's space and construction cost are given over to","y":0.50290697659804195,"c":1,"x":0.21604938072873248,"w":0.67901234944661459,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"y":0.5161536281260688,"w":0.66686498006184891,"t":"air conditioning. 'But I have designed and built a series of buildings over the past","x":0.2180128971875924,"h":0.0183748508089423,"c":1},{"y":0.53343023244982235,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.22016461622464892,"w":0.67489710489908861,"c":1,"t":"three decades which have tried to reinvent some of these ideas and then measure"},{"c":1,"w":0.1243123499552409,"h":0.014202507140358422,"y":0.54960896719349928,"t":"what happens.","x":0.21976891207617996},{"h":0.01599373272647564,"c":1,"w":0.62151306152343755,"t":"To go forward into our new low-energy, low-carbon future, we would be well","x":0.22217585561604059,"y":0.57102970433967659},{"y":0.58600713492899925,"c":1,"x":0.21801856158344549,"h":0.018231104344164639,"t":"advised to look back at design before our high-energy, high-carbon present","w":0.62160003662109375},{"t":"appeared. What is surprising is what a rich legacy we have abandoned.'","c":1,"w":0.59711069742838541,"x":0.21792132651254179,"h":0.020949773709821762,"y":0.60020510970013619},{"t":"Successful examples of Short's approach include the Queen's Building at De","c":1,"h":0.017436816638995989,"y":0.62494092509537191,"x":0.21805818614091113,"w":0.63384882609049487},{"c":1,"h":0.01750900944776046,"y":0.64063493360855106,"w":0.66470886230468751,"t":"Montfort University in Leicester. Containing as many as 2,000 staff and students,","x":0.21805140318414659},{"c":1,"h":0.020838743104249491,"y":0.65252726487661417,"w":0.68739084879557288,"t":"the entire building is naturally ventilated, passively cooled and naturally lit, including","x":0.21802987798376536},{"t":"the two largest auditoria, each seating more than 150 people. The award-winning","c":1,"x":0.21805665828239776,"y":0.67131856208286789,"h":0.016958942121274356,"w":0.66882787068684901},{"h":0.015969054016544582,"x":0.22011974425630587,"w":0.61531056722005206,"t":"building uses a fraction of the electricity of comparable buildings in the UK.","y":0.68706219625403575,"c":1},{"t":"Short contends that glass skyscrapers in London and around the world will become","x":0.22009502056724936,"y":0.70987812401984007,"h":0.0163955194228389,"c":1,"w":0.68328740437825519},{"x":0.21805578155538,"y":0.72510905141232818,"w":0.66678629557291669,"h":0.018308637279784601,"c":1,"t":"a liability over the next 20 or 30 years if climate modelling predictions and energy"},{"t":"price rises come to pass as expected.","y":0.74263839812388532,"w":0.31275721232096365,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"x":0.22016460361607884},{"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"He is convinced that sufficiently cooled skyscrapers using the natural environment","x":0.21810698593515401,"w":0.67695475260416671,"y":0.7644287398570101},{"c":1,"x":0.22010542289782203,"t":"can be produced in almost any climate. He and his team have worked on hybrid","y":0.7790381704169691,"w":0.65449101765950513,"h":0.016951899084803324},{"h":0.017099803973985361,"x":0.22011081320239137,"t":"buildings in the harsh climates of Beijing and Chicago - built with natural ventilation","w":0.68324579874674485,"c":1,"y":0.794934656988039},{"c":1,"y":0.8109540634829856,"t":"assisted by back-up air conditioning - which, surprisingly perhaps, can be switched","w":0.68312759399414058,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.22016459801607557},{"w":0.63168726603190106,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.82703488360103217,"x":0.22016459732868118,"t":"off more than half the time on milder days and during the spring and autumn."},{"y":0.84859155313485313,"w":0.66883926391601567,"c":1,"x":0.22010538182120135,"h":0.018712208324382917,"t":"Short looks at how we might reimagine the cities, offices and homes of the future."},{"t":"Maybe it's time we changed our outlook.","x":0.22213341338918416,"y":0.86460630091285628,"w":0.32938931783040371,"h":0.015799559468515301,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.88271604948587612,"w":0.024691357612609877,"c":1,"t":"43","y":0.86918604632866725}]}